                <pb facs="0138" n="26" xml:id="pg26"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 7661/6.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Beaupré to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-08-03"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">August 3,
                    1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Beaupré states that matters have been arranged so that he thinks there will
                    be no more difficulty concerning the admission of deviled ham.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
